      "key": "gg.zpm.rad_emitter",
      "title": "Rad Emitter",
      "tier": "ZPM",
      "desc": "The Rad Emitter is the Death Ray's business end: a ZPM emitter that sprays radiation along a beam. It is a ZPM Assembly Line part.\n\nBuild it from a ZPM emitter, two lead plates, a block of enriched uranium dust, two Mechanical Parts T3, two ZPM circuits and soldering alloy. The research item is a Sonic Emitter, scanned in a Research Station. NEI shows the full recipe.\n\n[warn]It carries uranium. Wear full radiation hazmat when carrying a stack.[/warn]",
