      "title": "Small Nuclear Warhead",
      "tier": "ZPM",
      "desc": "The warhead is the payload of a tactical nuke rocket. It is a lead-shielded block of uranium and TNT wired for a ZPM fuze.\n\nCraft two at a time in a ZPM Assembly Line from lead plates, TNT dust, LuV circuits, enriched uranium dust and one Naquadah alloy plate, with soldering alloy. NEI lists the research item and the rest.\n\n[warn]Radioactive. A stack of warheads irradiates you unless you wear full radiation hazmat.[/warn]",
