      "title": "Tactical Nuke Rocket",
      "tier": "ZPM",
      "desc": "A rocket with a nuclear warhead. One is enough to level a neighborhood, so treat it like a decision.\n\nBuild it in the ZPM Assembly Line from a regular Rocket, a Small Nuclear Warhead, two Naquadah alloy plates, two lead plates, a ZPM circuit and soldering alloy. The research item is a Rocket.\n\n[warn]Radioactive, and it is the biggest explosion in the mod. Only fire it where nobody lives, and wear full radiation hazmat while you carry it.[/warn]",
