    {
      "key": "gg.zpm.nuke_launcher",
      "title": "Nuke Launcher",
      "tier": "ZPM",
      "desc": "A shoulder-fired nuclear weapon. Inside 60% of its blast radius it annihilates anything that lives, and a boss takes half of its maximum health.\n\nIt is an Assembly Line build, researched from the Grim Reaper. The inputs are two Hardened Steel Barrels, a Carbon Receiver, a ZPM electric motor, two ZPM circuits, four lead plates, four Naquadah alloy plates and eight screws, with soldering alloy and lubricant. The tactical nuke rocket is its ammo.\n\n[warn]The nuke is the largest blast in GregGuns. Do not fire it from inside your own base.[/warn]\n\n[note]Servers that keep explosions.blockDamage off leave the terrain intact. Creatures are still hit.[/note]",
